00:03:04.456 --> 00:03:05.457
Field trip.

64
00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:08.333
Now let's listen to a conversation.

65
00:03:08.633 --> 00:03:10.807
Sreypich, how was the exam?

66
00:03:12.117 --> 00:03:14.000
It was harder than the last one!

67
00:03:15.317 --> 00:03:16.480
Where did you study?

68
00:03:17.783 --> 00:03:20.738
In the library. It's quieter than the classroom.

69
00:03:22.050 --> 00:03:23.771
What's your favourite school day?

70
00:03:25.083 --> 00:03:28.072
Sports day! It's more exciting than a field trip.

71
00:03:29.383 --> 00:03:31.940
Grammar focus: Comparatives.

72
00:03:32.240 --> 00:03:34.402
This exam is harder than the last one.

73
00:03:34.702 --> 00:03:38.132
Short adjectives add -er. Long adjectives use 'more'.

74
00:03:39.117 --> 00:03:41.827
Now read and listen. A Busy School Week.

75
00:03:42.127 --> 00:03:44.730
