80
00:04:04.817 --> 00:04:07.434
Quiz time! Choose the correct answer.

81
00:04:07.734 --> 00:04:10.291
The library is blank than the canteen.

82
00:04:10.591 --> 00:04:14.488
A, quiet. B, quieter. C, more quiet.

83
00:04:18.483 --> 00:04:20.274
The answer is B: quieter.

84
00:04:21.783 --> 00:04:23.644
The head of a school is the blank.

85
00:04:23.944 --> 00:04:27.458
A, principal. B, classmate. C, librarian.

86
00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:33.717
The answer is A: principal.

87
00:04:35.217 --> 00:04:37.808
Sports day is blank exciting than a normal day.

88
00:04:38.108 --> 00:04:41.030
A, more. B, most. C, much.

89
00:04:45.017 --> 00:04:47.005
The answer is A: more.

90
00:04:48.517 --> 00:04:52.086
Now it's your turn to speak. What do you like most about your school?

91
00:04:57.386 --> 00:05:03.266
I like our library most. It is bigger than my classroom, and it is full of interesting books.

92
00:05:03.566 --> 00:05:05.450
Excellent answer, Sreypich!

93
00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:10.182
Great work today! You learned twelve new words and comparatives.

94
00:05:10.482 --> 00:05:14.179
Today's value is cooperation. Work together with friends.

95
00:05:14.479 --> 00:05:16.725
